*  DATUM      :  020507                                                *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  PROGRAMMET LÄSER FAKTURAFIL MED POLENINFO             *        
*                SKAPAR EN LISTA UT PER FAKTURA (MAX 8 FAKTUROR)       *        
*                PROGRAMMET SKAPAR:                                    *        
*                  LISTA W47672-001 -> W47672-008                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*-----------------------------------------FILES & COPYTEXTS                     
FILE W47672D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W47670                                                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
FILE W47672D2 PRINTER VB (130 0)                                                
FILE W47672D3 PRINTER VB (130 0)                                                
FILE W47672D4 PRINTER VB (130 0)                                                
FILE W47672D5 PRINTER VB (130 0)                                                
FILE W47672D6 PRINTER VB (130 0)                                                
FILE W47672D7 PRINTER VB (130 0)                                                
FILE W47672D8 PRINTER VB (130 0)                                                
FILE W47672D9 PRINTER VB (130 0)                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------        
*               ARBETSAREOR                                            *        
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------        
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
ORDERNR  W  5 A                                                                 
ORD3   ORDERNR     4 A                                                          
ORD2   ORDERNR +4  1 A                                                          
*                                                                               
CASEX    W  7 A                                                                 
CASE1  CASEX       1 A                                                          
CASE2  CASEX   +1  5 A                                                          
CASE3  CASEX   +5  1 A                                                          
*                                                                               
NAME     W 20 A                                                                 
KDARTURS W  6 A                                                                 
*                                                                               
INV-COUNTER W 5 N                                                               
DATE     W  6 N      MASK '999999'                                              
IDKOLLI  W  4 N      MASK '9999'                                                
IDARTNR  W  8 N      MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9'                                            
KVLEVART W  7 N      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9'                                             
IDDISTR  W  5 P                                                                 
IDKUNDNR W  7 P                                                                 
PRARTNTO W  9 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                                          
VALUE1   W  9 P 2                                                               
VALUEX   W  9 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                                          
VKARTNTO W  9 N 3    MASK 'ZZZZZ9999'                                           
O-IDFAKT W  7 P                                                                 
IDFAKT   W  7 N      MASK '9999999'                                             
W-TOTAL  W  9 P 2                                                               
TOTAL1   W 10 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9.99'                                         
TOTAL2   W 10 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9.99'                                         
TOTAL3   W 10 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9.99'                                         
TOTAL4   W 10 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9.99'                                         
TOTAL5   W 10 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9.99'                                         
TOTAL6   W 10 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9.99'                                         
TOTAL7   W 10 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9.99'                                         
TOTAL8   W 10 N 2    MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9.99'                                         
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------        
*               JOB SECTION                                            *        
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------        
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W47672D1                                                              
** W-TOTAL            = BILL-SUORDV-FAKT                                        
   DATE               = BILL-TIFAKT                                             
*                                                                               
   IF  BILL-IDFAKT NE O-IDFAKT                                                  
     INV-COUNTER = INV-COUNTER + 1                                              
     O-IDFAKT = BILL-IDFAKT                                                     
     W-TOTAL = 0                                                                
   END-IF                                                                       
   IDFAKT   = BILL-IDFAKT                                                       
   ORDERNR  = BILL-IDKUNDRF                                                     
   CASE2    = BILL-IDKOLLI                                                      
   CASE1    = ORD2                                                              
   NAME     = BILL-BEART                                                        
   VALUE1 ROUNDED  = BILL-KVLEVART * BILL-PRARTNTO                              
   W-TOTAL  =  W-TOTAL + VALUE1                                                 
   VALUEX   = VALUE1                                                            
   IDARTNR  = BILL-IDARTNR                                                      
   KVLEVART = BILL-KVLEVART                                                     
   PRARTNTO = BILL-PRARTNTO                                                     
   VKARTNTO = BILL-VKARTNTO                                                     
   KDARTURS = BILL-KDARTURS                                                     
   IDKUNDNR = BILL-IDKUNDNR                                                     
   IDDISTR  = BILL-IDDISTR                                                      
*                                                                               
   IF INV-COUNTER = 1                                                           
      TOTAL1 = W-TOTAL                                                          
      PRINT REPORT1                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF INV-COUNTER = 2                                                           
      TOTAL2 = W-TOTAL                                                          
      PRINT REPORT2                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF INV-COUNTER = 3                                                           
      TOTAL3 = W-TOTAL                                                          
      PRINT REPORT3                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF INV-COUNTER = 4                                                           
      TOTAL4 = W-TOTAL                                                          
      PRINT REPORT4                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF INV-COUNTER = 5                                                           
      TOTAL5 = W-TOTAL                                                          
      PRINT REPORT5                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF INV-COUNTER = 6                                                           
      TOTAL6 = W-TOTAL                                                          
      PRINT REPORT6                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF INV-COUNTER = 7                                                           
      TOTAL7 = W-TOTAL                                                          
      PRINT REPORT7                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF INV-COUNTER = 8                                                           
      TOTAL8 = W-TOTAL                                                          
      PRINT REPORT8                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
*                                                                               
*-----------------------------------------REPORT 1                              
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
    REPORT REPORT1   PRINTER W47672D2                            +              
                     LINESIZE     121                            +              
                     PAGESIZE    2000                            +              
                     NODATE                                      +              
                     NOPAGE                                      +              
                     NOADJUST                                    +              
                     SPACE          1                                           
*                                                                               
SEQUENCE BILL-IDKOLLI BILL-IDARTNR                                              
TITLE 1 'INVOICE NO:' IDFAKT '  DISTRICT: ' IDDISTR +                           
'    DATE:' DATE                                                                
HEADING IDKOLLI 'CASENO'                                                        
HEADING IDARTNR 'PARTNO  '                                                      
HEADING NAME 'DESC                '                                             
HEADING KVLEVART '   QUANT '                                                    
HEADING PRARTNTO '   PRICE '                                                    
HEADING VALUEX ' TOT PRICE'                                                     
HEADING VALUE1 'TOT'                                                            
HEADING VKARTNTO '  WEIGHT '                                                    
HEADING ORD3 'SNO '                                                             
HEADING CASEX 'CASE  '                                                          
HEADING KDARTURS 'ORIGIN'                                                       
HEADING IDKUNDNR 'CUSTNO'                                                       
LINE ORD3 CASEX IDARTNR NAME KVLEVART +                                         
PRARTNTO VALUEX VKARTNTO KDARTURS                                               
TERMINATION. PROC                                                               
DISPLAY 'TOTAL : ' TOTAL1                                                       
END-PROC.                                                                       
